<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal ups Pfizer target.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal ups Pfizer target.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal and Co said analyst David Saks raised his two-year target on Pfizer Inc to $100 from $94.</p>
<p>-- He boosted his 1997 earnings per share estimate on Pfizer to $3.50 from $3.45 and 1998 to $4.00 from $3.95. He rates the stock outperform with a 1996 estimate at $3.00.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 at 83-1/4.</p>
</text>
